                "text": "This shutdown has consequences \u2b07\ufe0f\n\n\ud83d\udc75 Seniors: Social Security delays\n\ud83c\udf96\ufe0f Veterans: Benefits & pay disrupted\n\u2708\ufe0f Travelers: Longer lines, cancellations\n\ud83d\udc68\u200d\ud83c\udf3e Farmers & homeowners: No flood insurance, no certainty\n\nEvery day Dems prolong this shutdown, the damage grows. GOP voted to keep govt open. Dems voted 3x to close it.",
